[thin] The 1.4 mm radial TPU waist is the selected 9 mm OD around the 6.2 mm gripping bore. This compliant section permits hand sliding with nominal 0.15 mm diametral tube interference, while the 11 mm flares capture the spool. Physical grip remains unqualified.
alternatives: A larger waist changes both lid seats and the flare capture geometry. A smaller bore increases tube interference; a rigid sleeve does not provide the requested compliant grip.
